eblog-line--center\">首先</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从四条大宫站搭上岚电</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">出发前往岚山</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">其实对增田来说</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这还是人生第一次去岚山！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">首先来到的是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">天龙寺</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/001-1298cdc5a5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/001-1298cdc5a5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n足利尊氏为悼念后醍醐天皇的亡灵\n\n于1339年创建的禅寺\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界文化遗产</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/002-cea03cb7e4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/002-cea03cb7e4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n庭院太棒了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/003-829c2f026f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/003-829c2f026f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n竹林也太棒了！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/004-f8c01ee6a5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/004-f8c01ee6a5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n枫叶深浅不一的绿色也很美！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/005-6d1577b03c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/005-6d1577b03c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n一切都像画一样！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后当然\n不只是参观……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n参禅也……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/006-9248b6e2b7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/006-9248b6e2b7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n比如，人为什么活着……之类的问题\n\n<br>\n\n\n老师把这些深奥的话题\n讲得浅显易懂\n而且还非常有趣！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n坐禅也好，听讲也好\n都让我受益匪浅！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n不过……\n腿好痛啊（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n接下来是\n宝严院\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/007-8805f5bddc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/007-8805f5bddc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n苔藓很多，也很有京都的感觉\n大概是因为湿度很高吧\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这样看着京都……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n建筑并不是只作为建筑物\n单独存在……\n\n<br>\n\n\n建筑与植物\n彼此交织相乘\n共同构成了一幅景色\n真的太棒了！\n太美了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n前往岚山山脚\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/008-9d188bcb3b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/008-9d188bcb3b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n原来岚山比想象中坡度还陡啊！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/009-b8ee52cb5e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/009-b8ee52cb5e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n首先上船！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/010-f885bfa417.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/010-f885bfa417.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"946\" height=\"944\"></a></figure>\n\n祇园  有佳子小姐\n\n<br>\n\n\n和美丽的艺伎小姐交谈……\n\n<br>\n\n\n聆听笛子的演奏……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/011-386873b218.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/011-386873b218.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"916\" height=\"1020\"></a></figure>\n\n祇园  槇子小姐\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n享受船、河流、交谈、美酒\n以及音乐……\n\n<br>\n\n\n人生第一次体验到的\n奢侈时光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这真是一次来自异次元世界的\n体验！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n更进一步！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/012-21a015d82e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/012-21a015d82e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1132\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n人生第一次来到岚山吉兆\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这下可不能马虎\n\n\n吃饭礼仪也提前学习了一番（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这次的学习会\n\n<br>\n\n\n在老师的带领下\n\n京都的历史\n\n京都的文化\n\n京都的美好\n\n<br>\n\n\n这一切\n\n都远远超出了我的想象！\n\n<br>\n\n\n人生中处处都是第一次（笑）\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/013-98a96b214e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/013-98a96b214e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n夜晚的祇园\n\n<br>\n\n\n这个景色真不错啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n艺伎小姐\n有佳子小姐、槇子小姐\n谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠内容）\n详细介绍天龙寺！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/014-451876946a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/014-451876946a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"474\" height=\"540\"></a></figure></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ものを作るには</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">いろいろと知ることや体験も必要！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日常は自分で作れても</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">非日常は自分ではなかなか作れない・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ひとりの先生のご尽力により</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">非日常を体験する事に！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">まずは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">四条大宮駅から嵐電に乗り</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">いざ嵐山へ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">実はマスダ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">嵐山へは人生初！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">最初に来たのは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">天龍寺</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/001-1298cdc5a5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/001-1298cdc5a5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n足利尊氏が後醍醐天皇の霊を慰めるため\n\n1339年に創建された禅寺\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界文化遺産</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/002-cea03cb7e4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/002-cea03cb7e4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n庭が素晴らしい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/003-829c2f026f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/003-829c2f026f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n竹林も素晴らしい！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/004-f8c01ee6a5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/004-f8c01ee6a5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nモミジの緑の濃淡も美しい！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/005-6d1577b03c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/005-6d1577b03c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\nすべてが絵になる！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてもちろん\n見学だけではなく・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n参禅も・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/006-9248b6e2b7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/006-9248b6e2b7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nひとは何故生きるのか・・・など\n\n<br>\n\n\n深い話を分かりやすく\nしかも面白く\nお話ししてくださいました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n座禅もお話も\n非常に勉強になりました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nしかし・・・\n足が痛かったぁ（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n次は\n宝厳院\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/007-8805f5bddc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/007-8805f5bddc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n苔が多いのも京都っぽい\n湿度が高いのでしょうね\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこうして京都と見ると・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n建築物が建築物だけで\n終わっていなくて・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n建築物と植物が\n掛け算されて\nひとつの景色が生まれているんですよね\nほんと素晴らしい！\n美しい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n嵐山の麓へ\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/008-9d188bcb3b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/008-9d188bcb3b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n思っていたよりも急斜面な嵐山！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/009-b8ee52cb5e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/009-b8ee52cb5e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nまずは舟へ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/010-f885bfa417.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/010-f885bfa417.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"946\" height=\"944\"></a></figure>\n\n祇をん  有佳子さん\n\n<br>\n\n\n美しい芸妓さんと会話し・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n笛の演奏を聞き・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/011-386873b218.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/011-386873b218.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"916\" height=\"1020\"></a></figure>\n\n祇をん  槇子さん\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n舟と川と会話とお酒\nそして音楽を楽しむ・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n人生初の\n贅沢な時間！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれは異次元の世界の\n体験でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらに！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/012-21a015d82e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/012-21a015d82e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1132\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n人生初の嵐山吉兆さん\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさすがに\n\n\n食事作法も事前に勉強した（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今回の勉強会\n\n<br>\n\n\n先生による\n\n京都の歴史\n\n京都の文化\n\n京都の素晴らしさ\n\n<br>\n\n\nすべてが\n\n想像を超えるものばかり！\n\n<br>\n\n\n人生初のことばかりでした（笑）\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/013-98a96b214e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/013-98a96b214e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n夜の祇園\n\n<br>\n\n\nこの風景とても良いですね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n芸妓さんの\n有佳子さん  槇子さん\nありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n天龍寺を詳しく！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/014-451876946a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3816260/014-451876946a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"474\" height=\"540\"></a></figure></div>"}}